  "text": "AFK Vindicta and Gorvek (HM)\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nMagic AFK Method (~27 kph)\n​\nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMandatory Requirements\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ At least 4 pieces of Cryptbloom armour \n⬥ Zemouregal's Nexus  \n    • Deathwarden nexus may not be as consistent.\n⬥ Masterwork Staff \n⬥ Ring of Retribution \n⬥ Vampyrism Gloves \nAbilities\n⬥ Animate Dead \n⬥ Emerald Aurora \n⬥ Prism of Restoration \nOther\n⬥ Thermal Bath and Bonfire HP boost\n    • Wearing HP boosting armour when you get your bonfire boost will increase the amount of bonus health received from the bonfire\n⬥ Hellhound familiar \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ AFK Magic \n​\nUse  when your hellhound gets below half hp.\n​\n\nAction Bar\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ AFK Magic \n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Vindicta and Gorvek (HM) ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Magic AFK Method (~27 kph) ​ Overview Mandatory Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ At least 4 pieces of Cryptbloom armour ⬥ Zemouregal's Nexus • Deathwarden nexus may not be as consistent. ⬥ Masterwork Staff ⬥ Ring of Retribution ⬥ Vampyrism Gloves Abilities ⬥ Animate Dead ⬥ Emerald Aurora ⬥ Prism of Restoration Other ⬥ Thermal Bath and Bonfire HP boost • Wearing HP boosting armour when you get your bonfire boost will increase the amount of bonus health received from the bonfire ⬥ Hellhound familiar ​ Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ AFK Magic ​ Use when your hellhound gets below half hp. ​ Action Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ AFK Magic ​",
